  {
   "name": "places/ChIJr7W4U98GdkgRan-_jm-tzJI/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210UVUzVlNZMHRKWTFaQmEyZ3hPRlpsTFdKbVFXYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "Finding a salon that nails every service is rare, but Prestige Hair and Beauty in West Croydon is officially my new go-to! I visited recently for a full \"glow up\"—nails, lashes, and henna brows—and I couldn't be happier with the 5-star experience.\nNails: My nail technician was a perfectionist. I'm usually quite picky about the shape and finish, but they handled my request with such precision. The result is flawless, durable, and exactly the look I was going for.\nLashes: The lash application was incredibly relaxing. The technician took the time to understand the style I wanted, ensuring they looked full and glamorous without feeling heavy or \"fake.\" They’ve stayed perfectly in place and have completely cut down my morning makeup routine.\nHenna Brows: This was the standout for me! The henna brow service was done with so much care. The shape is crisp and symmetrical, and the tint is the perfect shade to complement my skin tone. It’s given my face so much more definition.\nThe atmosphere in the salon is welcoming, professional, and clean, and the staff are clearly experts at what they do. If you're in West Croydon and need a reliable spot for your beauty treatments, I can’t recommend Prestige enough. I’ll definitely be back!\n🥰🥰🥰🥰🤩🤩🥰🥰🥰🤩🥰🤩🥰🥰🤩🥰🤩🥰🤩🥰🤩🥰🥰🥰🤩🥰🤩🥰🤩🥰🥰🤩",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
