   "name": "places/ChIJr7W4U98GdkgRan-_jm-tzJI/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ObFRuaFVZVko1WDB0VGRYUlBaV05rTTJNM09HYxAB",
   "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago",
   "rating": 5,
   "text": {
    "text": "\"I had an absolutely fantastic experience at Prestige Hair, Beauty & Nails! From the moment I walked in, I was greeted by a warm and professional team who made me feel completely relaxed. The salon is spotlessly clean, and they truly pay attention to every detail. I had a full set of acrylics and an eyebrow wax, and I am so thrilled with the results. The nail technician was meticulous, ensuring my nails were perfectly shaped and the polish was flawlessly applied. It’s so great to have such a dedicated, high-quality salon right in the heart of Croydon.Such an amazing salon! The staff at Prestige are incredibly friendly, skilled, and professional. My nails look absolutely beautiful, and the brow waxing was completely painless and perfectly shaped.  I will definitely be back and highly recommend them!\"",
    "languageCode": "en"
   },
   "originalText": {
